<h1 class="tcs-policy-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
<div class="entry-content">

		<p>Thank you for shopping with https://thecoffeesleeves.com/. This Shipping Policy explains how your orders are processed, shipped, and delivered.</p>
<div>
<h2><strong>1. Order Processing Time</strong></h2>
<p>All orders are processed during regular business hours, Monday through Friday.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Standard processing time: <strong>1–3 business days</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Custom size or custom printing orders: <strong>3–7 business days</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If we experience delays, we will contact you by email.</p>
<h2><strong>2. Shipping Methods</strong></h2>
<p>We work with reliable carriers to ensure safe and timely delivery. Available shipping methods may include:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Standard shipping</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Expedited shipping</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Priority shipping</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Shipping options will appear during checkout based on your location.</p>
<h2><strong>3. Shipping Rates</strong></h2>
<p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout. Rates depend on:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Order weight</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Destination address</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Selected shipping method</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Some promotional periods may include free shipping.</p>
<h2><strong>4. Estimated Delivery Time</strong></h2>
<p>Delivery time begins after your order has been processed. Typical delivery windows:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>United States: <strong>3–7 business days</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Canada: <strong>7–12 business days</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>United Kingdom &amp; Australia: <strong>10–15 business days</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Other international locations: <strong>10–20 business days</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Delivery timelines may vary based on customs clearance, carrier delays, or high-season traffic.</p>
<h2><strong>5. Tracking Information</strong></h2>
<p>Once your order ships, you will receive an email with a tracking number (when available). You can use this number to monitor the delivery progress.</p>
<h2><strong>6. Incorrect or Incomplete Addresses</strong></h2>
<p>Please ensure your shipping address is correct at checkout. Orders returned due to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Incorrect address</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Missing apartment number</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Undeliverable location</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>may require additional payment for reshipping.</p>
<h2><strong>7. Lost or Missing Packages</strong></h2>
<p>If a package is marked as delivered but you did not receive it:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Check with neighbors or building management</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Check around your mailbox or doorstep</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Allow 24 hours for carrier updates</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If the package is still missing, contact us at <strong><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">info@thecoffeesleeves.com</a></strong> and we will assist you.</p>
<h2><strong>8. Damaged Shipments</strong></h2>
<p>If your order arrives damaged, please email us with photos of the package and the product. We will provide a replacement or help resolve the issue based on the situation.</p>
<h2><strong>9. International Shipping</strong></h2>
<p>International orders may be subject to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Customs fees</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Import taxes</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Duties</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>These charges are the responsibility of the customer. Customs processing may also extend delivery times.</p>
<h2><strong>10. Contact Us</strong></h2>
<p>If you have questions about your shipment, tracking, or delivery, you can contact us:</p>
<p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+15033580443">(503) 358-0443</a><br /><strong>Email:</strong> <strong><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" href="mailto:info@thecoffeesleeves.com" rel="noopener">info@thecoffeesleeves.com</a></strong><br /><strong>Address:</strong><br />303 W 137th Street, #5A<br />New York, NY 10030<br />United States</p>
